<title>HONG KONG: Lion Asia year net profit HK$18.21 mln.</title>
<headline>Lion Asia year net profit HK$18.21 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   8.7   vs 57.5</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil   vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil   vs 92.87 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    18.21 vs 120.74</p>
<p>    Turnover		     26.98 vs 206.37</p>
<p>    Company name		 Lion Asia Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Lion Asia ia a property investment and securities trading group.</p>
<p>The company changed its financial year end to June 30 from December 31. The comparative figures are for the 18-months ended June 30, 1995.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
